# Ignore data directories
data/raw/
data/bronze/
data/silver/
data/catalog/
# Ignore everything in gold except the plot images
data/gold/*
# Exception: the PNG stills are versioned so the README renders without a pipeline run.
!data/gold/plots/
!data/gold/plots/*.png
# The interactive Plotly HTML is NOT versioned: each file embeds the whole Plotly
# library (~4.6 MB each, 74 MB for the combined report), which totalled over 148 MB
# of generated artefact — more than 99% of the repository. Regenerate with
# `python main.py`.
data/gold/plots/*.html
.venv/
logs/
outputs/
*.egg-info/
*pycache*
